## MCP - Image OCR

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/image-ocr

**Input (RFC-014):**
```json
{
  "context": {
    "image_url": "https://...",
    "file_type": "jpg",
    "project_id": "...",
    "guild_id": "...",
    "user_id": "..."
  },
  "plugin_context": {
    "api_keys": { "mistral": "..." }
  }
}
```

**Legacy Input:**
```json
{
  "image_url": "https://...",
  "mistral_api_key": "..."
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { "text": "...", "pages": [...] },
  "meta": { "provider": "mistral" }
}
```

